    "notes": "<p>Master of the Wastes' torture pits: a tall, emaciated figure of blackened charcoal skin glowing from within, needle teeth, and a long whip of solidified flame. Flayers patrol the sites of old atrocities, drawn to the lingering psychic residue of pain, and their greatest joy is an echo — a scream coming back off the desolation.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Golachab, the Pyres — the Hull of Geburah. Severity unmoored from judgment: burning cruelty for its own sake.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'It is an artist, and you are the medium. Deny it an audience: fight quiet.'</em></p>",
